1
00:00:43,231 --> 00:00:46,555
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,555 --> 00:00:49,558
=Episode 22=

3
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:53,760
Pull your top down a bit.

4
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:55,560
How else will you attract clients?

5
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:58,160
Mr. Li, you promised me

6
00:00:58,160 --> 00:00:59,400
this is just for networking,

7
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:00,962
and I won't have to drink.

8
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,708
Xia Na, here's the thing.

9
00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:05,120
Once we go inside,

10
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:07,930
just have fun and have a few drinks.

11
00:01:07,930 --> 00:01:08,945
Keep the client happy,

12
00:01:08,945 --> 00:01:11,280
- and opportunities will just flow in.
- Then I'm not going!

13
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:13,040
This isn't what we agreed on.

14
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:17,324
Don't you hit girls again!

15
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:20,800
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

16
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,401
Come on.

17
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:24,160
Sorry. I'm sorry.

18
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:25,360
All right.

19
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,909
Let's be reasonable here.

20
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,587
You signed the contract,

21
00:01:30,587 --> 00:01:31,645
which means you are mine.

22
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:34,120
So whatever I tell you to do,

23
00:01:34,520 --> 00:01:35,560
you do it.

24
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:36,920
Keep him happy tonight.

25
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:39,840
If he gets even slightly upset,

26
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,681
you'll pay dearly for it.

27
00:01:42,600 --> 00:01:43,712
What?

28
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:44,898
Want to break the contract?

29
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,760
Fine. Five million in termination fees.

30
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,160
I don't have that much.

31
00:01:49,160 --> 00:01:50,240
You don't?

32
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:52,320
Then do as you're told.

33
00:01:53,600 --> 00:01:54,741
Get in there.

34
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:09,041
Come on, sweetheart.

35
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:10,880
Let's link arms and share a drink.

36
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:12,360
Don't be shy.

37
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,800
Just finish this drink with me,

38
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:19,686
and the contract

39
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,054
is a done deal.

40
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:23,640
Come on.

41
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,280
Mr. Wang,

42
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,283
don't worry.

43
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:31,000
Xia Na is very obedient.

44
00:02:31,581 --> 00:02:33,440
Xia Na, pour the wine.

45
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:38,960
Mr. Li, I really can't.

46
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,720
- Come here.
- I want to go home.

47
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:42,728
Na,

48
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:44,459
what did you say?

49
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:45,817
I want to go home.

50
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,302
Say that again.

51
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:51,930
Na,

52
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,520
didn't I tell you?

53
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:55,574
As long as you
keep Mr. Wang happy today,

54
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:56,793
everything will be fine.

55
00:02:57,440 --> 00:02:58,640
Otherwise, just you wait.

56
00:03:02,920 --> 00:03:03,920
- Get over here!
- Xia Na.

57
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:10,480
Gu Xiaotang?

58
00:03:10,480 --> 00:03:11,760
Why are you everywhere?

59
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:13,160
You won't leave me alone, will you?

60
00:03:13,160 --> 00:03:14,760
This is none of your business. Get out!

61
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,800
Xia Na, come with me.

62
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:19,800
Who are you?

63
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:21,120
Who is this crazy girl?

64
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:23,080
Mr. Li, what is going on here?

65
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:25,440
Xiaotang, I'm warning you.

66
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,120
Don't push your luck!

67
00:03:27,880 --> 00:03:29,480
She's my talent, and this is a VIP room.

68
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,920
Security! Security!

69
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:36,080
What are you yelling for?

70
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:39,436
What? Trying to intimidate me?

71
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,231
Are you gangsters?

72
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:45,800
Mr. Wang, right?

73
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:47,440
If I remember correctly,

74
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:51,040
your wife is the daughter
of Hongda Materials' owner.

75
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:53,800
You can run a company

76
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:54,933
because of your wife.

77
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:57,120
Today, you're drinking

78
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:59,200
with all these pretty young girls
in this KTV.

79
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,680
If I tell your wife about it,

80
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:05,440
what do you think she'll do?

81
00:04:06,880 --> 00:04:08,680
Who... Who you are?

82
00:04:08,720 --> 00:04:09,800
Gu Xiaotang,

83
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:10,800
what nonsense is that?

84
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:11,960
Trying to threaten me?

85
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,240
Xia Na's signed with my agency.

86
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,520
She came here willingly.

87
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:15,645
What's it to you?

88
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,024
Willingly?

89
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:22,440
Do I need to tell the police

90
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:24,640
how you use training loans,
wardrobe fees,

91
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:26,160
and hostessing contracts

92
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:27,560
to trap minors?

93
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:29,582
Or maybe

94
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:33,311
I'll tell them

95
00:04:33,311 --> 00:04:34,720
your tax fraud and fake accounts.

96
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:37,415
You're threatening me?

97
00:04:37,747 --> 00:04:38,794
Where's your proof?

98
00:04:38,794 --> 00:04:40,964
- Where's your proof?
- Ms. Lei, Mr. Li's being too loud.

99
00:04:40,964 --> 00:04:42,118
Help him calm down.

100
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:43,440
I'm trying to talk to Mr. Wang.

101
00:04:55,880 --> 00:04:57,080
Mr. Wang,

102
00:04:57,080 --> 00:04:58,400
I'll pretend

103
00:04:58,400 --> 00:04:59,400
nothing happened today.

104
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:01,760
Stay away from Xingyao's people
from now on.

105
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:03,162
If I catch you again,

106
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:05,080
it won't end with just a talk.

107
00:05:05,080 --> 00:05:06,154
Can you do that?

108
00:05:06,400 --> 00:05:07,400
Yes, absolutely!

109
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:08,560
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry!

110
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:09,920
I'm leaving right now.

111
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,284
Leaving right now!

112
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,655
Xia Na,

113
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,745
come with me.

114
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:20,165
Xiaotang.

115
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:23,393
I'm sorry. I was so wrong.

116
00:05:23,393 --> 00:05:24,640
I really regret it.

117
00:05:25,960 --> 00:05:28,598
But what am I going to do
about the five-million-yuan penalty?

118
00:05:28,960 --> 00:05:30,094
Xiaotang.

119
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:32,445
What are you doing here?

120
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:34,240
You rushed off without saying a word,

121
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:36,560
so I figured you came looking for her.

122
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,840
Xia Na, don't worry.

123
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:40,760
That contract
is meant to intimidate you.

124
00:05:41,200 --> 00:05:43,080
It wouldn't hold up in court anyway.

125
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:45,680
Hear that? There's a way out.

126
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:47,640
But promise
you won't jump back into that trap.

127
00:05:47,960 --> 00:05:49,840
A man like him
will do anything for money.

128
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:51,720
Now, he's making you entertain clients.

129
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:53,160
Later, he'll control you

130
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:54,760
or even have you on an operating table,

131
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,480
selling your organs to a match.

132
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:57,920
You won't even know.

133
00:05:58,280 --> 00:06:01,040
- Organs?
- What she's describing really happens.

134
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:03,160
Your organs are worth more
than your penalty

135
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:04,920
on the black market.

136
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:06,600
Then what should I do?

137
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,858
Xiaotang, Ye Shen,

138
00:06:08,858 --> 00:06:10,080
you have to save me!

139
00:06:10,520 --> 00:06:11,540
Let's go home first.

140
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:12,769
You need to calm down.

141
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:14,618
As for the contract,

142
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:16,510
we'll find a way.

143
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:19,834
Let's go.

144
00:06:39,080 --> 00:06:40,160
Director Li,

145
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,219
cool off.

146
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:42,400
Who are you?

147
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:43,442
Do I know you?

148
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,680
It doesn't matter who I am.

149
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,794
What matters is

150
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,960
we share a common enemy.

151
00:06:49,400 --> 00:06:50,507
An enemy?

152
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:52,040
Gu Xiaotang.

153
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,654
What?

154
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:56,193
You know her too?

155
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,040
Not only do I know her,

156
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:01,000
in a way,

157
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,040
she's practically my boss.

158
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,620
What's your point?

159
00:07:04,358 --> 00:07:05,395
Director Li,

160
00:07:05,395 --> 00:07:06,920
Xiaotang is probably having someone

161
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:09,242
dig through your books
and contracts right now.

162
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:12,320
She's even teamed up with Ms. Lei.

163
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,760
Who knows what scheme
she's plotting against you?

164
00:07:14,760 --> 00:07:15,965
She's investigating me?

165
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:18,647
Why should I believe you?

166
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:19,727
Director Li,

167
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,116
think about it.

168
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:23,640
How does she seem
to know everything in advance?

169
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,920
How did she know about Mr. Wang?

170
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:28,000
And the Red Star
Textile Factory explosion,

171
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:30,000
she told us
three days before it happened.

172
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,600
There's something wicked

173
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:33,770
about that woman.

174
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:35,993
It's almost like she can see the future.

175
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:39,040
Now that you mention it... Yeah.

176
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,360
It's a bit creepy.

177
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:42,737
I was wondering

178
00:07:42,737 --> 00:07:45,080
why she felt so oddly familiar.

179
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:46,520
Right?

180
00:07:46,520 --> 00:07:47,800
Director Li, think about it.

181
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:49,480
What if

182
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:51,600
you could turn her foresight

183
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:53,400
to your advantage?

184
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:56,240
That'd be far more lucrative
than running a modeling agency.

185
00:07:58,440 --> 00:07:59,826
Well, look at you.

186
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,000
Interesting.

187
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:05,437
Ye Shen,

188
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:07,000
thank you for the past few days.

189
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,611
Don't mention it.

190
00:08:16,440 --> 00:08:17,578
Na,

191
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:19,758
I'm sorry.

192
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:23,240
I got so caught up
in the bad things I thought might happen

193
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:24,520
that I forgot what mattered.

194
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:27,680
When things go wrong,

195
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,840
I can't just blame others.

196
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:30,640
I'm responsible too.

197
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:31,707
Xiaotang,

198
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:33,021
stop it.

199
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:35,280
I should be thanking you.

200
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:38,240
If you hadn't pulled me
out of that trap,

201
00:08:38,920 --> 00:08:40,400
I might have...

202
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,274
We'll always

203
00:08:46,680 --> 00:08:48,040
be best friends,

204
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:49,833
right?

205
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,275
Of course, we will.

206
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:03,459
Xiaotang,

207
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,760
you said you kept looping

208
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:07,200
for a perfect ending.

209
00:09:08,040 --> 00:09:09,800
Is it perfect enough now?

210
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,320
Of course, it is.

211
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:22,280
My mom left that scumbag.

212
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:24,320
Na

213
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,520
is still by my side,

214
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:27,400
and Lu Qingyuan and Director Li

215
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:29,000
got what they deserved.

216
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:30,880
It's just a shame

217
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:32,320
there's one thing left.

218
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:34,325
What is it?

219
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:37,600
When are you going
to confess to the girl you like?

220
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,360
I already did.

221
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:46,573
When?

222
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:48,678
How come I didn't know?

223
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:50,160
I'll go get some water.

224
00:09:51,400 --> 00:09:53,320
Why did he stop halfway?

225
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,320
Aren't we friends?

226
00:09:55,760 --> 00:09:56,993
Xiaotang,

227
00:09:58,222 --> 00:09:59,560
can't you tell?

228
00:10:01,503 --> 00:10:02,551
Tell what?

229
00:10:02,871 --> 00:10:05,415
I told you before
that Ye Shen likes you.

230
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,240
No way.

231
00:10:08,560 --> 00:10:10,800
Didn't he just say
he confessed to someone?

232
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:12,000
I even gave him advice.

233
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:13,480
You're really...

234
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:15,840
Even a fool can tell

235
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:16,960
that he likes you.

236
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,330
Right, Auntie?

237
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:25,411
No...

238
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:28,600
That can't be.

239
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:35,320
Do you really believe in pure friendship
between a guy and a girl?

240
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:36,473
Of course, I do.

241
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:38,520
- Ye Shen and I...
- If you think there is,

242
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,480
then you're the one being loved.

243
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:43,035
Ye Shen

244
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,756
definitely has a crush on you.

245
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:50,360
A crush?

246
00:10:52,520 --> 00:10:53,520
(A secret crush)

247
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:56,245
(is like having
a secret little world of your own.)

248
00:10:56,880 --> 00:10:58,320
(Just watching from afar)

249
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,381
(is more than enough.)

250
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:04,934
Xiaotang,

251
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:07,760
if Ye Shen confesses
his feelings to you one day,

252
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:09,680
will you say yes?

253
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:10,705
I...

254
00:11:13,160 --> 00:11:15,440
- I...
- What are you hesitating for?

255
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:17,192
Isn't he good enough?

256
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,720
It's because he's so good

257
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:25,988
that I can't bear to...

258
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:28,080
Can't bear to?

259
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:31,246
Can't bear to what?

260
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:34,440
I was hurt by love once,

261
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:36,520
and it almost cost me my life.

262
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:39,721
He's the most important person
to me right now.

263
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:41,960
I can't risk turning what we have

264
00:11:42,560 --> 00:11:43,760
into something

265
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:46,160
that could fall apart and cost me him.

266
00:11:50,520 --> 00:11:51,800
I don't want to lose him.

267
00:12:36,237 --> 00:12:39,593
♪The face deep in the heart♪

268
00:12:39,785 --> 00:12:42,247
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

269
00:12:43,622 --> 00:12:47,322
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

270
00:12:47,533 --> 00:12:49,973
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

271
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:52,492
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

272
00:12:52,642 --> 00:12:55,399
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

273
00:12:55,399 --> 00:12:57,720
♪Even for just a second♪

274
00:12:59,065 --> 00:13:02,528
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

275
00:13:02,656 --> 00:13:04,505
♪And sunlight reverses♪

276
00:13:04,505 --> 00:13:07,975
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

277
00:13:08,331 --> 00:13:10,405
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

278
00:13:10,907 --> 00:13:14,316
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

279
00:13:14,573 --> 00:13:19,785
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

280
00:13:21,039 --> 00:13:23,604
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

281
00:13:23,646 --> 00:13:27,099
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

282
00:13:27,676 --> 00:13:30,639
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

283
00:13:31,384 --> 00:13:33,992
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

284
